⸻

Output

For each successfully processed species, the pipeline produced:
	•	*_longest.fa
FASTA file containing one protein per gene.
	•	*_longest.fa.ids.txt
List of retained protein accessions.

Example:

Padleri_longest.fa
Padleri_longest.fa.ids.txt
